   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# TypeII FlatSpace Taylor Unit Tests\n\nFlatSpace-specific tests for TypeII Taylor:\n- matter fermion point-detection and derivatives\n- generic holo/anti-holo guards\n- FlatSpace exponential polynomials",
